kisdetweaks.config.comment.additionalblockbreakingcooldown=Add a configurable amount of delay between two instant mined block.\nUseful when building redstone machines or your mouse is douvle clicking
kisdetweaks.config.comment.additionaldelay=The amount of dalay add between mining two blocks, in gametick.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autoclearghostblock=Automatically clear ghost blocks for you.\nNote some server may kick you because this send a lot packet in 1gt.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autoclearghostblockinterval=Interval between auto clearing ghost blocks, in gametick.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autodropcontainer=Drop all the content in the container you clicked.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autodropcontainertype=Change which type of container you want to drop, useful when using crafting station.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autofillcontainer=Fill the container with content above the limit in your inventory.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autofillcontainerlimit=Only fill item stacks above this limit.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autorefreshinventory=Automatically refresh you inventory.\nUseful when inventory changed quickly and out of sync with server.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.autorefreshinventoryinterval=Inventory between auto refresh inventory, in gametick.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.backgroundfpslimit=Limit the game fps when not focused, saves some CPU and GPU usage.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.customtitle=Change the game title to whatever you want.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.clienttime=The client time you want to override, in gametick.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.perimeterwalllist=Block blacklist that get checked on the highest y value.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.blockhitlist=Block list that you want to black/white list.
kisdetweaks.config.comment.entityhitlist=Entity list that you want to black list, now it uses class name.

