kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.autofish=Automatically retract fish rod when about to catch a fish.\nStop auto re-use fish rod by switching to other item.\nThis might not work at high ping server.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.autorespawn=Auto respawn when player dies and close the respawn screen.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.betterf3ncycle=Now it works like 1.15, which you can directly switch to creative in non spectator mode.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.creativenoclip=Allows you to phase through wall when in creative flying.\nThis only works on single player, or need server side support to work.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.placeignoreentity=Allows you to place block inside of entity when in creative.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.stepup=Allows you to walk up one height blocks(0.6->1.125).
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.clienttimeoverride=Change the client time to whatever you want.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.nofall=You won't take fall damage.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.anvilrenamecopy=If you turn this on item in the anvil will automatically renamed to text from your clipboard.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.perimeterwallhelper=This prevents you digging blocks that has blacklisted block on the top.\nUseful when digging non-regular shape pit.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.preventdigblocksbelow=Prevents you digging blocks below you.\nUseful when digging. Sneak to override.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.fakenightvision=basically gives you night vision potion effect.\nNote this is different then GammaOverride.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.miningghostblockfix=Send one more right click packet after you mine block.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.alwaysrenderbarrierparticles=Render barrier particles as in creative holding barrier item.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.alwaysrenderbarriermodel=Render barrier block texture.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.alwaysrenderstructurevoidmodel=Render structure void texture.
kisdetweaks.feature_toggle.comment.quickblockswap=Enable this will let you place and break block in same gt, only works in creative.

