kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disableblockbreakingcooldown=Removes the cool down between mining two non-instant mined block.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disableslimebounce=Slime block acts like normal block, won't bounce player when jumping.\nWorks better with DisableSlimeSlowDown.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disableslowdown=Player won't be slowed down by cobweb, soulsand and using item.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disablepumpkinoverlay=Removes the texture when wearing pumpkin in helmet slot.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disablevignetting=Removes the annoying dimming effect when light level is low.\normally when you in noclip and your head is in non-translucent block.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disablewaterfov=Disables the fov change when your head is in water.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disablebeaconbeam=Disables beacon beam from rendering.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disableblockhit=This prevents you from both left click and right click the blocks that's in the list.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disableentityhit=This prevents you from hitting entities that's in the list.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disablecommandblockoutputtoconsole=Disable command block output to console regardless of gamerule logAdminCommands and CommandBlockOutPut.
kisdetweaks.disable_toggle.comment.disablerealmbutton=Remove the annoying realm button on the main menu.

